lora…ma anche i suoi pericoli!","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Baby esploratori alla riscossa!","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2019-04-03","status":"Released","rating":7.2,"ratingCount":231,"genres":["Animazione","Commedia","Avventura","Famiglia"],"countries":["France"],"facts":{"Runtime":"90m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1370967,"name":"Timothé Vom Dorp","role":"Willy (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qDMd9aaWb36rPt3jFxZgwtS1SZO.jpg"},{"id":41035,"name":"Édouard Baer","role":"Buck (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dXrcKH4VFwXs34e4UlUwEUdAh0g.jpg"},{"id":1826565,"name":"Marie-Eugénie Maréchal","role":"Mom (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/45D2ELhj5vPLbgqbEZEgIZ5K9U8.jpg"},{"id":1295322,"name":"Guillaume Lebon","role":"Dad (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5Wsc8UmY4iEH1nN1NOhkcaCzU3y.jpg"},{"id":1336655,"name":"Barbara Tissier","role":"Buck's internal voice (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oAhObnVhqsdJHO6vlMuW2a82Mwa.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"A spasso con Willy","overview":"A seguito della distruzione della loro navicella, il giovane Willy viene separato dai genitori con cui viaggiava nello spazio. La sua capsula di salvataggio atterra su un pianeta selvaggio e inesplorato. Con l’aiuto di Buck, un robot di sopravvivenza, dovrà cavarsela fino all’arrivo dei soccorsi. Nel frattempo Willy, Buck e Flash, una creatura aliena con cui hanno fatto amicizia, scopriranno il pianeta, la sua fauna, la sua flora…ma anche i suoi pericoli!","tagline":"Baby esploratori alla riscossa!"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Astro Kid","overview":"Terra Willy: Unexplored Planet — Upon the destruction of their ship, Willy is separated from his parents. He lands on a wild and unexplored planet and with the help of Buck, a survival robot, he will have to hold until the arrival of a rescue mission.","tagline":"An out-of-this-world adventure"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Suite à la destruction de leur vaisseau, le jeune Willy est séparé de ses parents avec lesquels il voyageait dans l’espace. Sa capsule de secours atterrit sur une planète sauvage et inexplorée. Avec l’aide de Buck, un robot de survie, il va devoir tenir jusqu’à l’arrivée d’une mission de sauvetage. En attendant, Willy, Buck et Flash, une créature extra‐terrestre avec laquelle ils se sont liés d’amitié, partent à la découverte de la planète, de sa faune, sa flore… mais aussi de ses dangers.","tagline":"Une aventure très spatiale"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9pNB3drwttYcbskxQG500e5PB2o.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9pNB3drwttYcbskxQG500e5PB2o.png","language":"en","width":1273,"height":487}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bRoicryOmioUWShKnRXYAeVNHv7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bRoicryOmioUWShKnRXYAeVNHv7.jpg","language":"it","width":700,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vwqEIL5SrsZFVvileNe9LuHbJy7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vwqEIL5SrsZFVvileNe9LuHbJy7.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pkaPqjprkCOKHlmRYonXxBLFoPD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pkaPqjprkCOKHlmRYonXxBLFoPD.jpg","language":"en","width":1530,"height":2161},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tJlleeus2jwvQogjvQ3kzjFtYwp.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tJlleeus2jwvQogjvQ3kzjFtYwp.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lS5FGnW8tXY1mwKWpyy3vJz0vFT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lS5FGnW8tXY1mwKWpyy3vJz0vFT.jpg","language":"en","width":960,"height":1440},{"type":"poster","url":